{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9HZXJtYW4tTGFuZ3VhZ2UvVGhlJTIwU2lsZW50JTIwRm9yZXN0JTIwJTI4MjAyMiUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"The Silent Forest","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/xdJwvRM6sVbEccPaVsavWSYCeAM.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iqDQxR7YC3t2V4Bc7HOikG7QqSb.jpg","description":"As a forestry student doing an internship, Anja Grimm ends up in that remote area in the Upper Palatinate Forest, where she went on vacation with her parents as an eight-year-old girl and her father disappeared without a trace. Her job is to take soil samples to create a soil map. At one point in the forest floor she comes across abnormal irregularities. Not long after their arrival, a brutal murder occurs. Anja soon arouses suspicion and hostility not only among the villagers with her suspicion that the perpetrator knows something about her father's fate and with her questions about the atypical soil composition in the forest clearing. Even the police react extremely reservedly to their investigations. And when it turns out that the young woman can read the signs of the forest like an open book, forces mobilize in the village who are apparently ready for anything because there is a dark secret that needs to be kept.\n\nReleased 27 Oct 2022 · Germany · Language: German · 95 min\nStudio: if... Productions, HR, SR\n\nOn your server — Audio: Hindi (from file names)","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Mystery","Thriller","Crime","Drama","Others"],"imdbRating":"5.6","imdb_id":"tt9145510","moviedb_id":926967,"tmdbId":926967,"runtime":"95 min","cast":["Henriette Confurius","Robert Stadlober","Noah Saavedra","August Zirner","Johanna Bittenbinder","Christoph Jungmann","Johannes Herrschmann","Moritz Katzmair"],"director":["Saralisa Volm"],"writer":["Wolfram Fleischhauer"],"released":"2022-10-27T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"The Secrets Of The Past Are Buried Deep","country":"Germany","language":"German","app_extras":{"ca